# Story: a chat app is in front, and has shortcuts of its own on ⌃⌥ and a letter; one of them puts the open conversation away. Arbor's icon is in the
# menu bar, so the fingers believe that Arbor's keys are Arbor's. On a tester's Mac one of them reached the app, twice (IDEAS I16).
# The rule (QUESTIONS Q29, 2; board 0.1): while Arbor's item is in the menu bar a key of the map in effect never reaches another app, unless the person
# said so themselves: for an app, for all, or by pausing Arbor. Where nobody said anything and Arbor merely cannot act, it keeps its keys,
# takes the press, does nothing and says why.
open Chat
open Notes
focus 101
# The control: Arbor runs. Its keys are its own, and a key that is not Arbor's goes to the app.
key ctrl+opt+space
expect app-got nothing
key ctrl+opt+shift+cmd+f12
expect app-got ctrl+opt+shift+cmd+f12

# 1. The permission is taken away, with nothing out of view. Nobody tells Arbor; it asks every two seconds.
revoke
wait 10
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+left on
key ctrl+opt+left
expect fail
expect said Arbor needs the Accessibility permission
expect still
# Still the one from the control: nothing has come after it.
expect app-got ctrl+opt+shift+cmd+f12
grant
wait 2
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+left on

# 2. A start without the permission: a first launch, and every launch of a new build whose signature the old grant does not fit, while
# the switch in System Settings still looks on.
revoke
relaunch
expect replied waiting for Accessibility permission
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+left on
key ctrl+opt+left
expect fail
expect said Arbor needs the Accessibility permission
expect still
expect app-got ctrl+opt+shift+cmd+f12
# It starts by itself when the permission comes, and the key works.
grant
wait 2
status
expect replied running
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+left on

# 3. A pause: the person said so. The keys are the apps' again, which the line says, but for the one that ends the pause.
key ctrl+opt+escape
expect said its keys are the apps’ again
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+left off
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+escape on
key ctrl+opt+left
expect app-got ctrl+opt+left
key ctrl+opt+escape
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+left on
